# Call-site ledger of honcho at 8af63177405a574612abf90ef55aaa68d76f7686 (v2.0.0).
# Decide every `undecided` line; see macro-benchmark/README.md.
#
# Analysed source: honcho/ (root "."), 15 modules. Supported: CPython 3.8
# and later, PyPy 3.9 and later (CHANGELOG 2.0.0 drops CPython 3.6, 3.7 and
# PyPy 3.7, 3.8; no requires-python, so no upper bound), on every platform
# ("Operating System :: OS Independent"): the Windows branches of compat.py,
# printer.py, process.py and command.py run, and so does the 3.8/3.9 branch of
# command.py (honcho.md).
# Missing modules (not installed in the trace environment): colorama (a
# dependency on win32) and backports.entry_points_selectable (a dependency
# before 3.10), named by their access paths. Jinja2 (the extra "export") is
# installed and named by its public paths.

